	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Master Rance...'
	R
	'     That’s not how the song goes...」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Shut up.'
	R
	'　　　   It’s fine this way.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「By the way, be sure to hold on to the lunch,'
	R
	'      Sill.'
