	'      If you drop it you’re getting a spanking.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Yes, Master Rance...」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill was putting her best effort into lugging a'
	R
	'lunch box with food for five people in it while'
	R
	'taking in her surroundings.'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「It’s beautiful...'
	R
	'     I like this place, Master Rance.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Mhm, perfect place for some outdoor sex.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Ah... Ahaha...」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Lia「Darling!'
	R
	'　　　 Look, look!!'
	R
	'　　　 A stream!! Let’s catch some fish!」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Mhm.'
	R
	'　　　　  I’ll look for shells.'
	R
	'　　　   Catch fish by yourself.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Lia「Aaaw!'
	R
	'　　　 Then I’ll look for shells too!'
	R
	'　　　 I want a sakura shell.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Any sakura shells are mine.'
	R
	'　　　　  You can have all the clam shells.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Lia「Geez, you’re so mean!」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Gahahahahaha!」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Hm? What’s wrong, Maris?'
	R
	'　　　   You look down...」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris「It’s nothing...」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris（Haah... Why did we bring this flag just for a'
	R
	'      picnic...?）'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Raise that flag high.'
	R
	'　　　　  It’s to tell everyone that the king is here.'
	R
	'      Gahahahahahahaha!!」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris「Yes, fine.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Lia「Ah, Harumaki!'
	R
	'　　　 Look at the birds flying!」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Harumaki「Raaawr raaawr.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Lia「Harumaki’s having fun too, Darling.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Hohoh.'
	R
	'　　　　  Mere beasts don’t even know what fun is.'
	R
	'      Gahahahahahahahaha.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Lia「You should fly too, Harumaki.'
	R
	'　　  Go!」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Harumaki「Rawrawraaawr.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Lia「Huhuhu.'
	R
	'　　　 You sound kinda pathetic, Harumaki.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Alright, shall we eat here?'
	R
	'　　　　  Get the food out, Sill.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Yes, Master Rance.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「You made sure to put pink unyuun in there,'
