	R
	'     There you go.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Mm... Munch, munch, munch...'
	R
	'      Haaah～～, that’s good!!」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Lia「What about me, slave?」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Ah, here you go, Queen Lia.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Lia「Hmph... It’s good, Darling.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Yeah.」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Here’s yours, Ms. Maris...」'
	\L_03b47:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris「Thank you.」'
